# Kafka Connect ServiceLoader manifest for the Lenses SMT collection.
#
# Kafka Connect's reflective plugin scanner does not discover SMTs whose class
# hierarchy passes through a package-private abstract base (for example the
# Insert*TimestampHeaders family, which extends InsertTimestampHeaders /
# InsertRollingTimestampHeaders). Referencing those transforms then fails with
# "Class ... could not be found", even though they are on the plugin path.
#
# Declaring every concrete Transformation here makes them discoverable via the
# ServiceLoader, which works regardless of the superclass visibility and enables
# plugin.discovery=service_load. See:
# https://kafka.apache.org/documentation.html#connect_plugindiscovery
